    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled within the peaceful and highly sought-after enclave of Belgree Court, Kilbride, this impressive detached four-bedroom bungalow offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a spacious family home on a beautifully mature site extending to approximately 0.19 hectares (0.47 acres). Belgree is a small development of 14 bespoke bungalows on a private road. Surrounded by mature trees, well maintained gardens and enjoying an enviable level of privacy. This wonderful residence has been thoughtfully designed to provide generous living accommodation, superb entertaining areas and a tranquil lifestyle, all while remaining within easy reach of Dublin and neighbouring towns of Hollystown, Blanchardstown, Dunboyne, Ratoath, Ashbourne and Dublin Airport. From the moment you step inside, the home offers a welcoming sense of space and warmth, with well-proportioned rooms designed for modern family living. Every room has been carefully planned to maximise comfort, natural light and functionality, making this an ideal home for growing families. One of the standout features of this exceptional property is its dedicated entertainment space. Perfect for hosting family and friends. Whether it's relaxing with family or entertaining guests, this unique addition creates the perfect social hub within the home. Viewing by appointment only. Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.”"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - \nTiled entrance porch with sliding door\n\nHall - \nLaminate floor, painted walls with dado rail\n\nKitchen - \nFitted with base and eye level storage cupboards,tiled floor and 1/2 tiled walls, Rangemaster cooker with Gas hob and electric oven, door leading to recreational room\n\nDinnng Room - \nFreshly painted walls, dado rail, laminate floor underfoot, double doors to rear garden\n\nLiving Room - \nDouble aspect windows, marble fireplace, freshly painted walls with dado rail, laminate floor underfoot\n\nMain Bathroom - \n3 Piece suite, shower over bath, tiled floor and bath area, wood panelling and window for natural light\n\nMain Bedroom - \nPosition to the rear of the property this double bedroom has built in wardrobe, painted walls and laminate floor underfoot.\n\nEn- Suite shower room - \nLinoleum floor covering, window for natural light, separate shower room, tiled with triton electric shower\n\nBedroom 2 - \nTo the front of the property this double room has painted walls, laminate floor underfoot and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - \nTo the rear of the property this double bedroom has freshly painted walls, laminate floor underfoot and electric heater\n\nBedroom 4 - \nTo the front of the property this double room is freshly painted, laminate floor underfoot and double doors to the front\n\nRecreational Room - \nA standout feature of this property, this impressive purpose-built home bar offers the perfect space for entertaining family and friends. Finished with a handcrafted timber bar, exposed timber ceilings, wood flooring and a wealth of character, the room comfortably accommodates both relaxed seating and bar-style entertaining. With ample space for social gatherings, sporting events or celebrations, this unique entertainment room provides a true pub atmosphere within the comfort of your own home.\n\nEntertaining space - \nAn outstanding leisure space designed for entertaining, this impressive games room offers the perfect setting for family gatherings and social occasions. Centred around a full-size pool table, the room also features an attractive fireplace with bespoke display shelving, extensive wall space showcasing memorabilia, and a dedicated seating area. Filled with natural light and offering ample room for recreation, this versatile space is ideal as a games room, sports lounge, hobby room or teenager's retreat, making it a fantastic extension to the home's already exceptional entertainment facilities.\n\nOutside - \nThe property is surrounded by beautifully maintained wraparound gardens, offering an exceptional sense of space, privacy and tranquillity. A sweeping lawn extends across the front of the home, complemented by a generous driveway with secure gated access and ample parking.To the side and rear, the gardens continue with expansive lawns bordered by mature trees, established hedging and ornamental planting, creating a peaceful, secluded setting that is not overlooked. Several patio areas provide the perfect spaces for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing while enjoying the picturesque surroundings. Mature specimen trees add character and shade, while the open lawns offer plenty of room for children to play, pets to roam or keen gardeners to further enhance the landscape.Beautifully landscaped and wrapping around the entire home, this exceptional outdoor space combines privacy, versatility and year-round enjoyment, making it a true extension of the living accommodation.\n\nIncluded in the sale - \nAll fixtures and fittings, built in appliances, curtains, blinds\n\nLocation - \nKilbride is a small rural village in southeast County Meath, located approximately 10km of Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Dunboynre, 8 km southwest of Ashbourne, 7 km southeast of Ratoath, 19 km to Dublin Airport close to the border with County Dublin, It lies within the Dublin commuter belt.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Stunning private setting </li><li>Located on the Dublin Meath Border</li><li>Mature Estate - only 14 houses in development</li><li>Gated driveway</li><li>Ample parking </li><li>Fenced rear garden for privacy </li><li>OFCH </li><li>Bio cycle system</li><li>Bright and spacious layout</li><li>Ideal for family recreation </li><li>Potential home cinema, hobby room or home office</li><li>Exceptional entertainment space</ul>"
      },
